md=['# HUMAN Input Architecture Review','','Status: architecture recommendation only. No approved methodology, source=HUMAN input, review validity or owner gate was changed.','','## Findings and counts','','667 means23 issuer-specific rubric selections x29 eligible issuers, not667 distinct people or necessarily667 separate approval clicks. Each selection is an auditable declaration with16 fields, named band and bounded integer points; metadata fields do not multiply the number of decisions. H classifications are review judgments over the existing contract, not new scoring rules.','','| Class | Meaning | Definitions per issuer | Slots across29 |','|---|---|---|---|']
